      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PK  = Primary Key\nFK  = Database Foreign Key (Same Schema)\nref = Cross-Context Logical Ref (No FK)\n[UK]= Unique Constraint / Index\n\n─── Solid Line : Intra-Schema DB FK\n··· Dotted Line: Cross-Schema Logical Ref\n- - Dashed Line: Semantic Vector Search\n\n🟡 Central Registry Entity\n🟠 Orchestration Pipeline Runner\n🔵 Assessment Snapshots & Verdicts\n🟢 Care Advice & 3NF Normalized Actions\n🟣 Character Companion Persona\n🔮 pgvector Care RAG Knowledge Store",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PK  = Primary Key\nFK  = Database Foreign Key (Same Schema)\nref = Cross-Context Logical Ref (No FK)\n[UK]= Unique Constraint / Index\n\n─── Solid Line : Intra-Schema DB FK\n··· Dotted Line: Cross-Schema Logical Ref\n- - Dashed Line: Semantic Vector Search\n\n🟡 Central Registry Entity\n🟠 Orchestration Pipeline Runner\n🔵 Assessment Snapshots & Verdicts\n🟢 Care Advice & 3NF Normalized Actions\n🟣 Character Companion Persona\n🔮 pgvector Care RAG Knowledge Store",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
